  "description": "<p>The modules in fcrepo-camel-toolbox follow the naming convention of:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;feature&gt;-&lt;backend&gt;</p>\n\n<p>for example:</p>\n\n<p>audit-triplestore<br/>\nindexing-solr</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to rename those so that they are all prefixed by fcrepo-:</p>\n\n<p>fcrepo-audit-triplestore<br/>\nfcrepo-indexing-solr</p>\n\n<p>These all will continue to live in the org.fcrepo.camel groupId</p>",
